<section class="service-band">
  <div class="shell service-band__grid">
    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
      <div {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
        <h3>{{ block.settings.heading }}</h3>
        <p>{{ block.settings.body }}</p>
      </div>
    {%- else -%}
      <div><h3>In-house tailoring</h3><p>Hemming, name tapes, and patch work done on site — no third-party turnaround.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Department accounts</h3><p>Purchase orders and agency billing handled the way your business office expects.</p></div>
      {%- comment -%}
        "Walk-in fittings" became "Call ahead" on 2026-08-15. Three sources publish three different
        sets of opening hours for this shop and none is confirmed, so inviting someone to walk in is
        inviting them to a possibly locked door — the Google profile currently says closed Tuesday,
        Thursday and Saturday. Restore the walk-in wording once the hours are settled.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div><h3>Fitted in person</h3><p>Call ahead for a fitting at the Johnstown store, or scheduled on-site sizing for your shift.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Stocked locally</h3><p>Duty staples held on the shelf, so a replacement does not wait on a vendor.</p></div>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Service band",
  "max_blocks": 4,
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "item", "name": "Service", "settings": [
      { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading" },
      { "type": "text", "id": "body", "label": "Body" }
    ]}
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
